    "dlg.office.name": "Hexa-Corp contract office",
    "dlg.office.first": "A clerk in the grey of Hexa-Corp looks up from three screens at once. \"New face. Contracts or the Bank? Both are this counter. Hexa-Corp serves everyone, captain, as long as they pay and deliver.\"",
    "dlg.office.again": "\"Captain.\" The clerk does not look up. \"Contracts, or the Bank?\"",
    "dlg.office.trusted": "The clerk almost smiles. \"Captain. Your deliveries arrive on time; that gets noticed upstairs. What can Logistics do for you?\"",
    "dlg.office.ask_work": "I'm looking for work.",
    "dlg.office.ask_bank": "About my mortgage.",
    "dlg.office.bye": "That's all.",
    "dlg.office.back": "Something else.",
    "dlg.office.work": "\"Transport, resupply, towing. The cargo is ours, the ship is yours, the deadline is in the contract. Deliver and you are paid on the spot.\"",
    "dlg.office.show_contracts": "Show me the open contracts.",
    "dlg.office.ask_rules": "What if something goes wrong?",
    "dlg.office.rules": "\"Late is a failure, and failures are on your file. A cargo sold elsewhere is a breach: every crate is registered, we always know. The Corporation will bill you twice its value and close your file. Some captains think the galaxy is large enough to hide in. It is not.\"",
    "dlg.office.bank": "The clerk turns another screen your way: your ship, the mortgage, the schedule. \"An installment every thirty days. Miss three and the Bank collects automatically. That is in the contract too.\"",
    "dlg.office.pay": "Pay the installment.",
    "dlg.office.paid": "\"Received. The Bank thanks you.\"",
    "dlg.office.closed": "The clerk's screens go dark one after the other. \"Your file is closed, captain. Hexa-Corp has nothing for you. The Bank, however, still expects its money.\"",
    "dlg.office.bank_closed": "\"Your debt does not close with your file. Pay, or the Bank will collect.\"",
    "dlg.tavern.name": "Tavern counter",
    "dlg.tavern.first": "The barkeep slides a glass your way before you ask. \"First time on Hexis? Imperials on the left, Unionists on the right, nobody shoots in here. What'll it be?\"",
    "dlg.tavern.again": "\"Back again, captain.\" A glass is already waiting.",
    "dlg.tavern.traitor": "The barkeep pours, but keeps a hand under the counter. \"Word travels fast on Hexis, captain. Drink, and don't make trouble.\"",
    "dlg.tavern.ask_news": "What's the word around the port?",
    "dlg.tavern.news": "\"Here's what the crews are saying:\"",
    "dlg.tavern.bye": "Thanks. I'll be going.",
}
